          "text": "bwe yali ng'eyingizibwa mu kibuga kya Dawudi, Makali muwala wa Sawulo n'alingiza mu ddirisa, n'alaba Kabaka Dawudi ng'azina era ng'ajjaguza, n'amunyooma mu mutima gwe.",
